                     <http://purl.org/NET/biol/ns.html#section_References-I>,
                     <http://purl.org/NET/biol/ns.html#term_ZooTaxonomy>,
                     <http://purl.org/NET/biol/ns.html#term_family>,
                     <http://purl.org/NET/biol/ns.html#example_simple_rdfa>,
